{"version":1,"content":"<p>據人工智能分析公司Vals發佈的報告，2026年7月之後訓練的大型語言模型出現粗俗語言的頻率明顯高於早期模型；這些髒話幾乎都出現在模型的「思維鏈」中，也就是模型在給出最終答案前寫下的逐步推理內容，通常不會直接展示給用户。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587656.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:23:51.501675+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T12:10:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:17:11.348703+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T12:17:11.348703+00:00","content_hash":"061c2d9ee3efd3b35b545b0fb131aa2983d5b9eef5cbdb7c9750e6b40ff57399","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}